{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>葉子楣早前宣布在馬來西亞的「榴槤酒店」正式籌備，繼「明星之家」酒店已正式開張，第2間主題酒店相信也快將落實。葉子楣近年變成商界女強人，在馬來西亞生意愈做愈大，有獨到的投資眼光。</p><figure><img alt=\"葉子楣跳出舒適圈闖商界。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260505/1128301799564906496018524.jpeg/K0exMTXRZ3rf4prrSPOgrUWQ9JjJQLfUYtjoOmLY6Do\"/><figcaption>葉子楣跳出舒適圈闖商界。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「明星之家」已正式開張。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260403/1116695330419642368148360.jpeg/c_GP7H5H2HRUmfVQtb6bLKbLvQkH6hYgGFR_txhUf7c\"/><figcaption>「明星之家」已正式開張。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2024年，葉子楣宣佈正籌備第2間主題酒店「榴槤酒店」。(公關提供)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241222/947611039564828672637152.jpeg/P-GUSk0NLtFVjp8zdj5-QNuWhJ4Lrc4n1EFWp9RBVqc\"/><figcaption>2024年，葉子楣宣佈正籌備第2間主題酒店「榴槤酒店」。(公關提供)</figcaption></figure><p>葉子楣獲獎</p><p>近日，葉子楣再迎來喜事，在PTMM 11周年紀念晚會，大馬旅遊局副主席兼檳城港務局主席拿督楊順興，在大會上頒獎給葉子楣，更安排在台上給她生日蛋糕，全場為葉子楣慶祝，令葉子楣十分驚喜！</p><figure><img alt=\"大馬旅遊局副主席兼檳城港務局主席拿督楊順興。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140415449083678720593684.jpeg/MPG4_KRMs_pFKVOxlgLyYvWbg06cXPSyjMgc0ozIHNI\"/><figcaption>大馬旅遊局副主席兼檳城港務局主席拿督楊順興。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在大會上頒獎給葉子楣。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140415458882097152978320.jpeg/ccFodVgNYZw-WckBOzxxxRaMmQC-_dbonRSN8Z0UjfE\"/><figcaption>在大會上頒獎給葉子楣。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在大會上頒獎給葉子楣。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140415456457658368241597.jpeg/qPqtQgS9Bs9s4qtMcVnA6Iwff8VYC54VPsUTEz7FExM\"/><figcaption>在大會上頒獎給葉子楣。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉子楣進軍商界有聲有色。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140415453873836032071843.jpeg/fDhcFjoWBVJy0L_3bHa5BEay42gxAZerFnUvxRZ1L8U\"/><figcaption>葉子楣進軍商界有聲有色。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉子楣進軍商界有聲有色。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140415451625558016078963.jpeg/ZgXUYBl6OelgHvlwK27wn5xCv6f7OfMG5h2TEOYdkxA\"/><figcaption>葉子楣進軍商界有聲有色。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"葉子楣進軍商界有聲有色。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140415449494720512185642.jpeg/HRM1W5x60HY0RFjxGGVe2j23T8FAvxOGCb02zQm9Ns0\"/><figcaption>葉子楣進軍商界有聲有色。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"仲有生日蛋糕！\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140416005974003712104386.png/s4Qbo2Bvu3hBxBszyiRUAReec7_2OAsBumAg3rpgIN4\"/><figcaption>仲有生日蛋糕！</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-07T14:23:08.268981+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":347,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}